B.aGM=s(["The gate is open. The scouts are counting on you.","Smoke rises on the eastern hills again.","Watch yourself out there."],t.s)
B.aqr=s(["So it is true. The Warchief has fallen.","You went east to find our scouts, and you ended a war.","Take this gift of swift feet: hold your stick and run.","Wyn in the village needs a hand. Go see him."],t.s)
